Tutorial Characteristics
------------------------

Simulation time: 2.5 seconds (default)
Time step: Adaptive (controlled by preCICE)
Output: VTK files for post-processing
Coupling: Implicit parallel scheme

Expected runtime: ~5-10 minutes (depending on hardware)
Suitable for: CI/CD automated testing


